            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.95

- Scrubbing and clicking a lyric line on Amazon Music now go through the player's own seek, so they no longer depend on where the progress bar happens to be drawn or fail while it is briefly missing between tracks.
]]></description>
